  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/gorc1/). VERDICT: MIS-PREMISED. 2026-11-01 review (dev 100b6fbb6e, caddy df65455): survey still gives 120/136 CaddyModule methods with incoming calls/dispatches_to - the same 16 after INV-javid. init->RegisterModule resolves (87 calls to in-tree modules.go RegisterModule). 15 of the 16 are non-struct named types (MatchHost/MatchPath/VarsMatcher/PEMLoader/FileLoader/...); all 119 reachable are structs. go.py attaches implicit-satisfaction base_classes only to kind=='struct'. The 16th, ListenerWrapper, shares its name with an interface (not verified). MECHANISM: structural interface satisfaction stamped on struct symbols only. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-punat."  # 8f67
